        "Description": "In the car race,two teams developed hostility towards each other due to their competitive relationship.\r\rA mechanic from the Kowoon team,dissatisfied with the performance of the Kronstadt team,accidentally killed one of their members in a conflict,and later caused another death in an accident.\r\rThe series of events set off a chan reaction,culminating in a staff member from the Kronstadt team killing a doctor.The atomsphere at the racetrack was filled with hatred and violence.",
